{
  "rule": "runPipeline (empty registry, mode \"save\") — block-level core semantics of the stored renderedAst: heading anchor ids (github-slugger, core/headings.ts), GFM table align (nullable entries), task-list checked (true/false/null), list shape (ordered/start/spread).",
  "why": "The page body is rendered by BOTH the web (mdast-util-to-hast over the stored bare Root) and the iOS native walker (v1 envelope), from two independent implementations. The nullable fields @types/mdast defines (table.align entries, listItem.checked, list.start) must survive both wire shapes verbatim — a null-vs-absent divergence silently breaks column alignment, task state, or ordered-list numbering on exactly one client.",
  "consumers": [
    "packages/api/src/renderer/golden-corpus.test.ts",
    "apps/apple/CrowiKit/Tests/CrowiKitTests/RenderedAstGoldenCorpusTests.swift"
  ],
  "consumerContract": "The api jest driver asserts the PRODUCER side (markdown → expectedAst via runPipeline with an empty registry, and storedAst/expectedAst → expectedEnvelope via sanitizeAst). The CrowiKit XCTest asserts the CONSUMER side (its sanitize-walker mirror over storedAst/expectedAst, and its strict envelope decoder over expectedEnvelope). The Swift consumer is wired up in Phase 4 (apps/apple lives on the feature-ios-app/impl branch).",
  "normalization": "none — expected values are exact.",
  "exclusions": "Plugin-dispatch output byte strings (Mermaid / PlantUML / link-card / shiki generated HTML) are deliberately NOT pinned by this corpus — packages/e2e/tests/renderer-plugins.spec.ts owns that coverage against a live server. The corpus pins parser/core-transform STRUCTURE and the v1 projection schema shapes only; where a stored html node value would be a generated byte string, the case either omits expectedAst (code.json) or uses a synthetic stand-in value the projection never reads (typed-nodes.json).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "heading-anchor-basic",
      "why": "data.hProperties.id is the anchor both clients jump by — the id must come from the server, never a client-local slugger",
      "markdown": "## Getting Started",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "depth": 2,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Getting Started"
              }
            ],
            "data": {
              "hProperties": {
                "id": "getting-started"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "expectedEnvelope": {
        "astVersion": 1,
        "root": {
          "type": "root",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "depth": 2,
              "data": {
                "hProperties": {
                  "id": "getting-started"
                }
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "Getting Started"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "heading-anchor-duplicate",
      "why": "github-slugger dedup: repeated headings get -1 / -2 suffixes in document order",
      "markdown": "## Setup\n\nbody\n\n## Setup\n\nbody\n\n## Setup",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "depth": 2,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Setup"
              }
            ],
            "data": {
              "hProperties": {
                "id": "setup"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "body"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "depth": 2,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Setup"
              }
            ],
            "data": {
              "hProperties": {
                "id": "setup-1"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "body"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "depth": 2,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Setup"
              }
            ],
            "data": {
              "hProperties": {
                "id": "setup-2"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "heading-anchor-cjk",
      "why": "CJK heading text is preserved verbatim in the slug (github-slugger keeps Unicode letters), not transliterated or dropped",
      "markdown": "## 日本語の見出し",
      "expectedAst": {
        "type": "root",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "heading",
            "depth": 2,
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "日本語の見出し"
              }
            ],
            "data": {
              "hProperties": {
                "id": "日本語の見出し"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
